+# Current mode: Codex OAuth through Codex CLI.
+#
+# Stack on top of base.yaml:
+#   python -m webwright.run.cli main -c base.yaml -c model_codex_oauth_text_vision.yaml ...
+#
+# The default agent uses gpt-5.3-codex-spark. Screenshot-oriented tools use the
